      "text": "/skill:tidy-recipe-authoring\n\nCreate tidy recipes for workbook `d5d6b50e15cf4bbbf0f9ef0b3cb711b3e415e778e9d1265e0b3859e7855bea42--45300do006_201011.xlsx`.\n\n- Publication: Crime Victimisation, Australia (Australian Bureau of Statistics)\n- Release or year: 2010-11\n- Sheets needing a recipe: 17 of 17\n\n| sheet | sheet_sha256 | current recipe |\n|---|---|---|\n| \"Contents\" | 5b4265c3efed689c8817d552ca7d704def41d168753d700caa8e460c0702dbb9 | missing |\n| \"Table 1\" | 035c5db3b32f0d853e333fc771855206ce319bbd197aef4c48a60213c1cf209c | missing |\n| \"Table 1a\" | c38739c36cbb12d951818b0a71761813cded32a0974226828030ecdc9aca725b | missing |\n| \"Table 2\" | b695fca6e938d8b94740416ae46bf290875ae9b39e72f24401fc9280aaae93db | missing |\n| \"Table 2a\" | f70aa3dead2d56d45c131a0035bd591631c5c1e841ce9ebe5111e29650235990 | missing |\n| \"Table 3\" | f3ec0de6547b1881cb007e0bc26e262ff7099400db780d136097ffe1cc1fa2d1 | missing |\n| \"Table 3a\" | 57aa4feb50902843173985c32fafb25131fc923fa96589ef28329b5c56db27ad | missing |\n| \"Table 4\" | c10d7782f378244003112f8c4c69b60dc07b067ef234c7b658bb17dd23908d11 | missing |\n| \"Table 4a\" | 91c3e8214f95398a5adc4f1c1e6e0b36b210169a3e0c06e82b53957802309c14 | missing |\n| \"Table 5\" | 830fc654bd25f6b85603724a29a57d4e9b323a7f7081034140f4472224ce3a0c | missing |\n| \"Table 5a\" | 2f0ca9bc584456e5bcc0f6098be38e4822dc87a4453705db09aceffd255e107e | missing |\n| \"Table 6\" | f9ddb9c48e8fc0952f3e8579b65b4ced13081fde7eed6635567c9a5c3dc6c805 | missing |\n| \"Table 6a\" | 31f10be820b739a5a7b1027d4e9e569f943e8c59c5783db6af90f244ab2e472f | missing |\n| \"Table 7\" | b4cd3058fb475fcdf7c07da7019210a6bbb344c0df0585668cfe12edce246e3e | missing |\n| \"Table 7a\" | 2f1f8a15e722786c438dea81178b04e8836fd26f67ce2fc9e788bc86f2bc0713 | missing |\n| \"Table 8\" | d5d30ac6bba62c4c686e3f2629739a9743ae992b8a9080bcc120b005defb73f5 | missing |\n| \"Table 8a\" | 8c9118880eb482ffd8fbd3bef789e6f8809434e6a0eb7577e618dd11e7734faa | missing |\n\nRelated workbooks:\n- None\n\nWork through every sheet listed above using the skill's workflow. Use\n`codemode` scripts to call the recipe tools, and batch the work: for example,\nlist the workbook and check templates for all sheets in one script, then read\ngrids and test recipes a few sheets at a time. Keep script output short.\n\nName dimensions from `dictionary/dimensions.csv` (see the skill's\n`references/naming.md`); declare any name it lacks in `new_dimensions`.\n\nWrite each recipe to `tidy-recipes/<sheet_sha256>.json` and finish every sheet\nwith `submit_recipe`. You may only write recipe files for this workbook.\n\nEnd with one line per sheet: `sheet | kind | status | records | remaining failures`."
